  _playSoundIndex: 0
  _senarioDescription: Now is the time to hold your ground. Grabbing the knife and
    gripping it for dear life, you set yourself in a stance ready to take on this
    creature as it sprints towards you. Sprinting down the stairs, here it comes.
    As you take a breath and blink, upon opening your eyes, it is already in your
    face, passing the first blow to you. The sharp pain hits your abdomen as you
    cough up blood. The adrenaline hits you, this allows you to dodge the next blow.
    While the creature recovers from its attack by regaining balance you take the
    advantage and deal a fatal blow to the back of the neck. Dirty tactics maybe
    but you do what you must to survive. The creature lets out a bellowing roar,
    followed by an intense thrashing, then finally releasing a blinding light. Upon
    opening your eyes the only thing remaining is a silhouette on the kitchen floor.
    After all that you still have no idea what that thing was. \nStand your ground
    - Ending
